	"data": "Journal — unknown\n\nSummary\n\nThe speaker excitedly explores applications of a newly discovered open-source 3D anatomy tool for their 'Project Mirror' concept, envisioning a VR interface that displays personal health data layered onto anatomical models with real-time sensor integration. They outline technical implementation strategies and learning pathway ideas before shifting to practical notes about their coding bootcamp coursework and interview preparation.\n\nMood & Energy\n\n| Signal | Acoustic…",
